{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Italy, 19th century</strong>. On a damp night, a strange light falls from the sky. In the kitchen of a solitary writer and gastronome, you\u2019ll be drawn into a mysterious descent into madness made of excesses, culinary rites, and secrets hidden from the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The warm comfort of the kitchen and the meticulous gestures of an expert hand are the only anchors left to keep your sanity intact.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976340/extras/b9f6ba5504c40cb346a6976be2b7d77e.poster.avif?t=1762773534\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976340/extras/b9f6ba5504c40cb346a6976be2b7d77e.webm?t=1762773534\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976340/extras/b9f6ba5504c40cb346a6976be2b7d77e.mp4?t=1762773534\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cucina Stellata \u2726 Starred Cuisine</strong> is a brief and immersive narrative experience, with psychological and literary horror at its very core. It blends the preparation of traditional Italian recepies with the exploration of the narrator\u2019s fractured mind, where flavor turns into madness and desire leads to an irreparable act.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976340/extras/f1b635f3394e152cb742ed063afa0702.poster.avif?t=1762773534\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976340/extras/f1b635f3394e152cb742ed063afa0702.webm?t=1762773534\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976340/extras/f1b635f3394e152cb742ed063afa0702.mp4?t=1762773534\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>19th-century Italy</strong>: an historical setting with authentic recipes and a carefully crafted literary register.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive cooking</strong>: prepare traditional Italian dishes with intuitive and satisfying interactions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rising horror</strong>: psychological tension, gore, and Lovecraftian inspirations blur the line between the grotesque and the sublime.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A sleepless night</strong>: a tightly woven short story, designed to be experienced in one sitting.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976340/extras/15ed0bba57a4bd843e6e8da41f1bece6.poster.avif?t=1762773534\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976340/extras/15ed0bba57a4bd843e6e8da41f1bece6.webm?t=1762773534\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976340/extras/15ed0bba57a4bd843e6e8da41f1bece6.mp4?t=1762773534\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Warning</strong><br>Contains disturbing images and mature themes.<br>The game does not include a save system: best enjoyed in a single uninterrupted session.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3976340?t=1762773534","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976340/57a4e2ba5698754062b1b43ebc12af31ee1e1881/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762773534","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976340/6ee6fae3b0260b51d02cdcdb3d2caed6dc3e4eb1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762773534","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976340/6ee6fae3b0260b51d02cdcdb3d2caed6dc3e4eb1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762773534","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Low-poly, low-resolution depictions of extreme gratuitous violence, self-harm, and disgusting scenes that may cause nausea."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Italy, 19th century</strong>. On a damp night, a strange light falls from the sky. In the kitchen of a solitary writer and gastronome, you\u2019ll be drawn into a mysterious descent into madness made of excesses, culinary rites, and secrets hidden from the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The warm comfort of the kitchen and the meticulous gestures of an expert hand are the only anchors left to keep your sanity intact.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976340/extras/b9f6ba5504c40cb346a6976be2b7d77e.poster.avif?t=1762773534\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976340/extras/b9f6ba5504c40cb346a6976be2b7d77e.webm?t=1762773534\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://